  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38948bbc0f96de7498bb32b64efae4ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: J2 - Mail 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Your second day at CHERUB!
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8db74389b8c31914dbe8c9c4cf3c818b, type: 2}
  mailText: "Hey, you know what? You seem alright, so I\u2019m gonna clue you in
    on a lil' something.\n\nTomorrow, company\u2019s about to hand over some long-overdue
    promotions to its best soldiers. That\u2019s the reason everyone\u2019s shooting
    daggers at each other right now.\n\nAnd of course, duty will fall on you to decide
    who\u2019s most deserving of the honors.\n\nI know! Might be overwhelming to
    already undertake responsibilities like this just as you came in. I mean, you
    don\u2019t even know anyone here, and it\u2019s not like you got anyone rooting
    for you.\n\nIf anything, most of them will want to tear you apart as soon as
    you give them a warning.\n\nTake my bit of advice. Don\u2019t let them. Doing
    what you do, you\u2019re bound to make\nsome enemies anyway. Can\u2019t please
    everyone!\n\nBut earning a few friends here and there can go a long way towards
    making you fit in.\n\nAnyways, just my two cents.\n\nAnd remember: <b>I am</b>
    rooting for you, pal!"
